# ============================================================
# IMPORTANT
# ============================================================
# Never commit:
# - .env files
# - API keys
# - LLM keys
# - MongoDB credentials
# - Email credentials
# - Private certificates
# - Service-account credentials
#
# Use .env.example for required environment variable names.
# ============================================================
